  "description": "Code defaults without an exemplar (difficulty multiplier 100000 [compat], so a 10,000 building at 9 % pays about 7,500,000 on hard; land-value curve (0,0)-(255,10); [choice] initial funds and tax rates from the shipped data); the shipped exemplar values with BondInterestRate x 0.01; partial arrays overlay the defaults [choice]; an empty curve keeps the default [choice]; the CS$$$ / CO$$$ weight bug of 13.1 and the optional fix; [choice] a zero interest rate gives L div n.",
